<apex:page standardController="Quote" extensions="SteelPipesQuoteController" renderAs="pdf" showHeader="false" sidebar="false" applyBodyTag="false">
    <head>
        <style>
            @page {
                size: A4 portrait;
                margin-top: 45mm;
                margin-bottom: 35mm;
                margin-left: 10mm;
                margin-right: 10mm;
                @top-center {
                    content: element(header);
                }
            }
            div.header { position: running(header); text-align: center; width: 100%; }
            body { font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.4; }
            table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 15px; word-wrap: break-word; }
            th, td { border: 1px solid black; padding: 4px; text-align: left; font-size: 9px; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all; }
            .header-text { text-align: center; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; }
            .bg-green { background-color: #92D050; font-weight: bold; }
            .text-center { text-align: center; }
            .text-right { text-align: right; }
            .no-border { border: none !important; }
            .bold { font-weight: bold; }
            p, li { margin: 6px 0; }
        </style>
    </head>
    <body>
        
        <div class="header">
            <apex:image url="{!$Resource.UtkarshHeader}" style="width: 190mm; height: auto;" alt="Utkarsh Header"/>
        </div>
        
        <!-- REF AND DATE -->
        <div style="width: 100%; clear: both;">
            <div style="float: left; width: 50%;"><b>REF:</b> {!quoteRecord.Quote_Reference__c}</div>
            <div style="float: right; width: 50%; text-align: right;"><b>DATE:</b> {!todayDate}</div>
        </div>
        <br/><br/>
        
        <!-- ADDRESS BLOCK -->
        <div>
            <b>TO,</b><br/>
            <b>{!quoteRecord.Account.Name}</b><br/>
            {!companyAddress}<br/><br/>
            
            <b>KIND ATTN:</b> {!quoteRecord.Contact.Name} ({!contactNo})<br/>
            <b>EMAIL ID:</b> {!contactEmail}<br/><br/>
            
            <b>SUB: OUR OFFER FOR STEEL PIPES OF BANSAL, UTKARSH BRAND.</b><br/>
            <b>Ref:</b> Please refer to your query &amp; the discussion had with us.<br/>
        </div>
        
        <!-- INTRO PARAGRAPHS -->
        <p>
            Your enquiry for supplying of the product as mentioned in the captioned subject has given us this opportunity to connect and introduce our company and the “Bansal, Utkarsh” brand and the various range of products of the company including and not limited to the “MS or GI ERW Pipes”.
        </p>
        <p>
            We take pride to mention that you have approached one of the leading brands in the country engaged in the manufacturing of the product as described herein and we can assure you that if you decide to accept our offer and place the purchase/supply order in our favor you will always feel proud for having made the right decision by relying upon the best quality product.
        </p>
        <p>
            Our offer and/or quotation for the MS ERW Pipes “Bansal, Utkarsh” brand as enquired by you is/are more clearly mentioned and recorded in the Annexure “A” to this quotation. The said Annexure “A” shall for all practical purposes be considered as a part of the present quotation.
        </p>
        
        <br/>
        <h3 style="text-align: center; text-decoration: underline;">ANNEXURE A</h3>
        
        <!-- THE TABLE -->
        <apex:outputPanel rendered="{!!isExport}">
        <apex:outputPanel rendered="{!standardLineItems.size > 0}">
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr style="background-color: #FFFF00;">
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 3%;">SL No</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 12%;">Pipe / Designation</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 6%;">Size<br/>(mm)</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 9%;">Thickness<br/>(mm/Std)</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 6%;">End Finish</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 8%;">IS Specification</th>
                        <apex:repeat value="{!specialHeaderCols}" var="col">
                            <th class="text-center" style="width: {!IF(col == 'Special Description', '9%', '5%')};">{!col}</th>
                        </apex:repeat>
                        <apex:outputPanel layout="none" rendered="{!showRateInDocDomestic}">
                            <th class="text-center" style="width: 7%;">Rate per Kg</th>
                            <th class="text-center" style="width: 7%;">Per Unit Price</th>
                        </apex:outputPanel>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 8%;">QTY</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 7%;">Quoted Price</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 9%;">Total</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <apex:repeat value="{!standardLineItems}" var="row">
                        <tr>
                            <td class="text-center">{!row['SlNo']}</td>
                            <td class="text-center">{!row['designation']}</td>
                            <td class="text-center">{!row['size_nb']}</td>
                            <td class="text-center">{!IF(ISBLANK(row['display_class_thickness']), '-', row['display_class_thickness'])}</td>
                            <td class="text-center">{!row['end_finish']}</td>
                            <td class="text-center">{!row['standard_spec_grade']}</td>
                            <apex:repeat value="{!row['specialValuesList']}" var="sVal">
                                <td class="text-center"><apex:outputText value="{!sVal}" escape="false"/></td>
                            </apex:repeat>
                            <apex:outputPanel layout="none" rendered="{!showRateInDocDomestic}">
                                <td class="text-right"><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!row['pdf_rate']}"/></apex:outputText></td>
                                <td class="text-right"><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!row['pdf_display_unit_price']}"/></apex:outputText></td>
                            </apex:outputPanel>
                            <td class="text-center">
                                <apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0}"><apex:param value="{!row['quantity']}"/></apex:outputText>&nbsp;{!IF(row['uom'] == 'Pieces', 'PCS', IF(row['uom'] == 'Meters', 'MTRS', row['uom']))}
                            </td>
                            <td class="text-right"><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!row['pdf_unit_price']}"/></apex:outputText></td>
                            <td class="text-right"><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!row['pdf_base_total']}"/></apex:outputText></td>
                        </tr>
                    </apex:repeat>
                    <!-- Freight Lump Sum row -->
                    <apex:outputPanel rendered="{!showLumpSumFreight}" layout="none">
                    <tr>
                        <td colspan="{!IF(showRateInDocDomestic, 9, 7) + specialHeaderCols.size}" class="text-right" style="font-weight: bold;">Freight (Lump Sum):</td>
                        <td colspan="2" class="text-right" style="font-weight: bold;">
                            <apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!lumpSumFreightAmount}"/></apex:outputText>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    </apex:outputPanel>
                    <!-- Freight Price per KG row -->
                    <apex:outputPanel rendered="{!showPricePerKgFreight}" layout="none">
                    <tr>
                        <td colspan="{!IF(showRateInDocDomestic, 9, 7) + specialHeaderCols.size}" class="text-right" style="font-weight: bold;">Freight (Price per KG):</td>
                        <td colspan="2" class="text-right" style="font-weight: bold;">
                            <apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!pricePerKgFreightAmount}"/></apex:outputText>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    </apex:outputPanel>
                    <tr>
                        <td colspan="{!IF(showRateInDocDomestic, 9, 7) + specialHeaderCols.size}" class="text-right" style="font-weight: bold; background-color: #FFFF00;">Sub Total:</td>
                        <td colspan="2" class="text-right" style="font-weight: bold; background-color: #FFFF00;">
                            <apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!standardTotalAmount}"/></apex:outputText>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td colspan="{!IF(showRateInDocDomestic, 9, 7) + specialHeaderCols.size}" class="text-right" style="font-weight: bold;">GST @18%:</td>
                        <td colspan="2" class="text-right" style="font-weight: bold;">
                            <apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!standardTotalGst}"/></apex:outputText>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td colspan="{!IF(showRateInDocDomestic, 9, 7) + specialHeaderCols.size}" class="text-right" style="font-weight: bold; background-color: #FFFF00;">Grand Total:</td>
                        <td colspan="2" class="text-right" style="font-weight: bold; background-color: #FFFF00;">
                            <apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!standardTotalFinal}"/></apex:outputText>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </apex:outputPanel>

        <!-- SPECIAL LINE ITEMS (if any) -->
        <apex:repeat value="{!specialLineItems}" var="spRow">
            <h3 style="text-decoration: underline; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-top: 15px;">SPECIAL ITEM - {!spRow['customHeader']}</h3>
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr style="background-color: #FFFF00;">
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 3%;">SL No</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 12%;">Pipe / Designation</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 6%;">Size<br/>(mm)</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 9%;">Thickness<br/>(mm/Std)</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 6%;">End Finish</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 8%;">IS Specification</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 12%;">{!spRow['customHeader']}</th>
                        <apex:outputPanel layout="none" rendered="{!showRateInDocDomestic}">
                            <th class="text-center" style="width: 7%;">Rate per Kg</th>
                            <th class="text-center" style="width: 7%;">Per Unit Price</th>
                        </apex:outputPanel>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 8%;">QTY</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 7%;">Quoted Price</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 9%;">Total</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="text-center">{!spRow['SlNo']}</td>
                        <td class="text-center">{!spRow['designation']}</td>
                        <td class="text-center">{!spRow['size_nb']}</td>
                        <td class="text-center">{!IF(ISBLANK(spRow['display_class_thickness']), '-', spRow['display_class_thickness'])}</td>
                        <td class="text-center">{!spRow['end_finish']}</td>
                        <td class="text-center">{!spRow['standard_spec_grade']}</td>
                        <td class="text-center" style="font-weight: bold;"><apex:outputText value="{!spRow['customValue']}" escape="false"/></td>
                        <apex:outputPanel layout="none" rendered="{!showRateInDocDomestic}">
                            <td class="text-right"><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!spRow['pdf_rate']}"/></apex:outputText></td>
                            <td class="text-right"><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!spRow['pdf_display_unit_price']}"/></apex:outputText></td>
                        </apex:outputPanel>
                        <td class="text-center">
                            <apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0}"><apex:param value="{!spRow['quantity']}"/></apex:outputText>&nbsp;{!IF(spRow['uom'] == 'Pieces', 'PCS', IF(spRow['uom'] == 'Meters', 'MTRS', spRow['uom']))}
                        </td>
                        <td class="text-right"><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!spRow['pdf_unit_price']}"/></apex:outputText></td>
                        <td class="text-right"><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!spRow['pdf_base_total']}"/></apex:outputText></td>
                    </tr>
                    <!-- Freight Lump Sum row -->
                    <apex:outputPanel rendered="{!showLumpSumFreight}" layout="none">
                    <tr>
                        <td colspan="{!IF(showRateInDocDomestic, 10, 8)}" class="text-right" style="font-weight: bold;">Freight (Lump Sum):</td>
                        <td colspan="2" class="text-right" style="font-weight: bold;">
                            <apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!lumpSumFreightAmount}"/></apex:outputText>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    </apex:outputPanel>
                    <!-- Freight Price per KG row -->
                    <apex:outputPanel rendered="{!showPricePerKgFreight}" layout="none">
                    <tr>
                        <td colspan="{!IF(showRateInDocDomestic, 10, 8)}" class="text-right" style="font-weight: bold;">Freight (Price per KG):</td>
                        <td colspan="2" class="text-right" style="font-weight: bold;">
                            <apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!pricePerKgFreightAmount}"/></apex:outputText>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    </apex:outputPanel>
                    <tr>
                        <td colspan="{!IF(showRateInDocDomestic, 10, 8)}" class="text-right" style="font-weight: bold; background-color: #FFFF00;">Sub Total:</td>
                        <td colspan="2" class="text-right" style="font-weight: bold; background-color: #FFFF00;">
                            <apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!spRow['pdf_base_total']}"/></apex:outputText>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td colspan="{!IF(showRateInDocDomestic, 10, 8)}" class="text-right" style="font-weight: bold;">GST @18%:</td>
                        <td colspan="2" class="text-right" style="font-weight: bold;">
                            <apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!spRow['pdf_gst_amount']}"/></apex:outputText>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td colspan="{!IF(showRateInDocDomestic, 10, 8)}" class="text-right" style="font-weight: bold; background-color: #FFFF00;">Grand Total:</td>
                        <td colspan="2" class="text-right" style="font-weight: bold; background-color: #FFFF00;">
                            <apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!spRow['pdf_total_price']}"/></apex:outputText>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </apex:repeat>
        </apex:outputPanel>

        <!-- ==============================================
             EXPORT TABLE (15 Columns)
             ============================================== -->
        <apex:outputPanel rendered="{!isExport}">
        <apex:outputPanel rendered="{!standardLineItems.size > 0}">
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr style="background-color: #FFFF00;">
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 10%;">Designation</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 10%;">Standard / Spec / Grade</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 6%;">Size (mm)</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 5%;">OD (mm)</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 5%;">Wall Thk (mm)</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 7%;">End Finish</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 6%;">Length (M)</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 7%;">Total Pcs</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 5%;">Kg/mtr</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 7%;">Total Mtrs</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 7%;">Total Weight (MT)</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 7%;">Price Basis</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 7%;">Unit Rate ({!exportCurrency})</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 7%;">Total FOB ({!exportCurrency})</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <apex:repeat value="{!standardLineItems}" var="row">
                        <tr>
                            <td class="text-center">{!row['designation']}</td>
                            <td class="text-center">{!row['standard_spec_grade']} - {!row['grade']}</td>
                            <td class="text-center">{!row['size_nb']}</td>
                            <td class="text-right"><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!row['od']}"/></apex:outputText></td>
                            <td class="text-right"><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!row['wall_thickness']}"/></apex:outputText></td>
                            <td class="text-center">{!row['end_finish']}</td>
                            <td class="text-right"><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!row['pipe_length']}"/></apex:outputText></td>
                            <td class="text-right"><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0}"><apex:param value="{!row['total_pieces']}"/></apex:outputText></td>
                            <td class="text-right"><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.000}"><apex:param value="{!row['kg_per_meter']}"/></apex:outputText></td>
                            <td class="text-right"><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!row['total_meters']}"/></apex:outputText></td>
                            <td class="text-right"><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.000}"><apex:param value="{!row['total_weight']}"/></apex:outputText></td>
                            <td class="text-center">{!row['price_input_type']}</td>
                            <td class="text-right"><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!row['price_fc']}"/></apex:outputText></td>
                            <td class="text-right"><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!row['total_fob_fc']}"/></apex:outputText></td>
                        </tr>
                    </apex:repeat>
                    <tr>
                        <td colspan="12" class="text-right" style="font-weight: bold; background-color: #FFFF00;">Sub Total:</td>
                        <td colspan="2" class="text-right" style="font-weight: bold; background-color: #FFFF00;">
                            <apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!totalExportFobFc}"/></apex:outputText>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </apex:outputPanel>
        
        <apex:repeat value="{!specialLineItems}" var="spRow">
            <h3 style="text-decoration: underline; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-top: 15px;">SPECIAL ITEM - {!spRow['customHeader']}</h3>
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr style="background-color: #FFFF00;">
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 10%;">Designation</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 10%;">Standard / Spec / Grade</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 6%;">Size (mm)</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 5%;">OD (mm)</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 5%;">Wall Thk (mm)</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 7%;">End Finish</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 6%;">Length (M)</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 7%;">Total Pcs</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 5%;">Kg/mtr</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 7%;">Total Mtrs</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 7%;">Total Weight (MT)</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 7%;">Price Basis</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 7%;">Unit Rate ({!exportCurrency})</th>
                        <th class="text-center" style="width: 7%;">Total FOB ({!exportCurrency})</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="text-center">{!spRow['designation']}</td>
                        <td class="text-center">{!spRow['standard_spec_grade']} - {!spRow['grade']}</td>
                        <td class="text-center">{!spRow['size_nb']}</td>
                        <td class="text-right"><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!spRow['od']}"/></apex:outputText></td>
                        <td class="text-right"><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!spRow['wall_thickness']}"/></apex:outputText></td>
                        <td class="text-center">{!spRow['end_finish']}</td>
                        <td class="text-right"><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!spRow['pipe_length']}"/></apex:outputText></td>
                        <td class="text-right"><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0}"><apex:param value="{!spRow['total_pieces']}"/></apex:outputText></td>
                        <td class="text-right"><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.000}"><apex:param value="{!spRow['kg_per_meter']}"/></apex:outputText></td>
                        <td class="text-right"><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!spRow['total_meters']}"/></apex:outputText></td>
                        <td class="text-right"><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.000}"><apex:param value="{!spRow['total_weight']}"/></apex:outputText></td>
                        <td class="text-center">{!spRow['price_input_type']}</td>
                        <td class="text-right"><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!spRow['price_fc']}"/></apex:outputText></td>
                        <td class="text-right"><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!spRow['total_fob_fc']}"/></apex:outputText></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td colspan="12" class="text-right" style="font-weight: bold; background-color: #FFFF00;">Sub Total:</td>
                        <td colspan="2" class="text-right" style="font-weight: bold; background-color: #FFFF00;">
                            <apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!spRow['total_fob_fc']}"/></apex:outputText>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </apex:repeat>
        </apex:outputPanel>

        <!-- ONLY RENDERING FOR DOMESTIC (!isExport) -->
        <apex:outputPanel rendered="{!!isExport}">
        <apex:outputPanel rendered="{!specialLineItems.size > 0}">
            <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                <tr>
                    <td class="text-right no-border" style="width: 82%; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12px;">OVERALL GRAND TOTAL:</td>
                    <td class="text-right" style="width: 18%; border: 1px solid #000; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12px; padding: 5px; background-color: #FFFF00;">
                        <apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!totalFinalAmount}"/></apex:outputText>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </table>
        </apex:outputPanel>
        </apex:outputPanel>

        <!-- TERMS AND CONDITIONS -->
        <div style="page-break-before: always;"></div>
        <h3 style="text-decoration: underline; margin-bottom: 10px;">TERMS &amp; CONDITIONS OF THE CONTRACT: -</h3>
        <ol style="padding-left: 20px;">
            <li><b>Payment Terms:</b> {!jsonData['tc_payment_terms']}</li>
            <li><b>Delivery:</b> {!jsonData['tc_delivery_period']}</li>
            <li><b>Transportation &amp; Freight:</b> 
                The rates are on&nbsp;<apex:outputText value="{!IF(jsonData['tc_transportation'] == 'Excluded', 'Ex-works', IF(jsonData['tc_transportation'] == 'Included', 'F.O.R', jsonData['tc_transportation']))}" /> 
                at {!jsonData['tc_work_address']}
            </li>
            <li><b>Inspection:</b> {!jsonData['tc_inspection']}</li>
            <li><b>Drawing/GTP:</b> It shall always be the absolute obligation of the Buyer to provide a proper legible valid GTP with all dimensions specifications and information of the product in order to undertake the manufacturing of the products based on the GTP. A 50% advance is mandatory along with the purchase order to undertake manufacturing of product based on drawing and balance before dispatch.</li>
            <li><b>Material Tolerance:</b> All dimensional tolerance like OD &amp; Wall Thickness (+/-) shall be as per applicable IS specification.</li>
            <li>UIL shall be responsible for the material as per specifications mentioned in GTP/PO. However, in case of any change in design by User or any Other competent authority, post the dispatch, UIL will not take back material on account of the same.</li>
            <li><b>Quality:</b> All quality related complaint to be informed to us in writing within 72 hours of receipt of material at site. Thereafter UIL may not accept any quality complaints.</li>
            <li><b>Weigh Bridge Tolerance:</b> Industry Standard Weigh Bridge tolerance of 0.5% applicable.</li>
